{"id":"greece10","name":"希臘主權債遭降為垃圾級","date":"2010-04-27","cat":"crisis","cat_name":"金融危機與信用事件","note":"標普同日調降葡萄牙，歐債危機擴散","approx":false,"background":{"note":"標普同日調降葡萄牙，歐債危機擴散","external":{"background":"希臘財政惡化難融資，S&P 降其評等至 BB+（垃圾級），歐元區首例","notes":"媒體標題『7,500 億歐元』= 歐方 5,000 億＋IMF 預期出資；IMF 部分只見新聞說法，未見 IMF 官方單獨數字，故未列。4 月降級當日希臘 ASE 指數跌約 6%，Greece 當時尋求最多 450 億歐元緊急貸款（CNN Money/Fox 轉述）；希臘 2009 年政府債務約 2,980 億歐元、占 GDP 126.8%（Eurostat 2010-11 修正，僅見希臘媒體轉述，未取得 Eurostat 原件）。降級本身沒有損失金額，影響以救助規模衡量。","headline":null,"impacts":[{"what":"EU 與 IMF 對希臘的三年期聯合救助方案 1,100 億歐元（IMF 自行標註約 1,450 億美元；IMF 備用安排 SDR 264 億≈300 億歐元為其中一部分）","usd_bn":145,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2010","source":"IMF Press Release No. 10/187 (2010-05-09)","url":"https://www.imf.org/en/News/Articles/2015/09/14/01/49/pr10187","source_quality":"primary","kind":"rescue_outlay"},{"what":"歐盟 2010-05-09/10 臨時財經首長理事會決議的歐洲穩定機制總量上限 5,000 億歐元（EFSF 最高 4,400 億＋EU 預算 600 億）；IMF 預期另提供至少歐方一半。以 IMF 同日隱含匯率 1.318 USD/EUR（145÷110）換算","usd_bn":659.1,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2010","source":"Council of the EU, Conclusions of the Extraordinary ECOFIN Council, 9–10 May 2010 (Presse 108, 9596/10)；經 CVCE.eu 收錄","url":"https://www.cvce.eu/content/publication/2013/12/4/1742f67d-f777-4645-89f0-ba5a537d9b83/publishable_en.pdf","source_quality":"primary","kind":"rescue_outlay"}]}},"pre":{"lag":null,"months":[{"m":"2009-04","n":9,"on":["dollar_ust","inflation_gold","cycle_sox","cycle_twii","cycle_hy","panic_vix","vix_25","spx_dd","rates_down"],"new":["cycle_hy"]},{"m":"2009-05","n":11,"on":["inflation_ust10","inflation_gold","fertilizer_agri","cycle_sox","cycle_twii","cycle_twd","cycle_hy","vix_25","dxy_down","spx_dd","gold_run"],"new":["inflation_ust10","fertilizer_agri","cycle_twd","dxy_down","gold_run"]},{"m":"2009-06","n":12,"on":["inflation_oil","inflation_ust10","inflation_gold","fertilizer_agri","cycle_cuau","cycle_sox","cycle_twii","cycle_twd","cycle_hy","vix_25","spx_dd","rates_up"],"new":["inflation_oil","cycle_cuau","rates_up"]},{"m":"2009-07